\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\n\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\n\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\nR^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}^{2}:\\phi\\subseteq\\theta\\},\n\\qquad\n\\theta\\preceq_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\phi\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\nR^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}^{2}:\\phi\\subseteq\\theta\\},\n\\qquad\n\\theta\\preceq_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\phi\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\phi),\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\theta)\n\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\phi),\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\theta)\n\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\theta\\preceq_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\phi\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(p^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi},\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\phi;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\theta\\preceq_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\phi\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(p^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi},\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\phi;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinQuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\theta,\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\rangle:\n\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinQuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\theta,\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\rangle:\n\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinBondFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle,\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi}\\right\\rangle:\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinBondFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle,\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi}\\right\\rangle:\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nI_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\subseteq I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}^{2}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\theta,\\theta\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi,\\psi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\land\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\to\\langle\\theta,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\land\\langle\\phi,\\theta\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\to\\theta=\\phi\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\land\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{FinQuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau):I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{FinBondFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau):\n\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau})\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau))\n\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(p^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi},\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\phi;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\theta}=\n\\mathrm{id}_{|\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)|}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi,\\psi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\land\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\to\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\psi}=\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi}\\circ p^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\phi\\psi}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FinQuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau),\n\\operatorname{FinBondFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau);\nI_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\bigr)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nI_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\subseteq I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}^{2}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\theta,\\theta\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi,\\psi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\land\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\to\\langle\\theta,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\land\\langle\\phi,\\theta\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\to\\theta=\\phi\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\land\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{FinQuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau):I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{FinBondFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau):\n\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau})\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau))\n\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(p^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi},\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\phi;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\theta}=\n\\mathrm{id}_{|\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)|}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\theta,\\phi,\\psi\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\theta,\\phi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\n\\land\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\to\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\psi}=\np^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi}\\circ p^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\phi\\psi}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FinQuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau),\n\\operatorname{FinBondFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau);\nI_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\bigr)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FinQuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau),\n\\operatorname{FinBondFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau);\nI_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},\\tau\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FinQuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau),\n\\operatorname{FinBondFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau);\nI_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},R^{\\mathrm{fq}}_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},\\tau\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle a,\n\\{\\langle\\theta,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\theta)\\rangle:\n\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\}\n\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle a,\n\\{\\langle\\theta,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\theta)\\rangle:\n\\theta\\in I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\}\n\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}:|\\mathbf A|\\to|\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau}|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}:|\\mathbf A|\\to|\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau}|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reverse inclusion makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi}\">\\(p^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\\theta\\phi}\\)</span> point from the finer quotient to the coarser quotient. The displayed closure assertion records the directed order, typed quotient and bonding families, homomorphism, identity, coherence, and nonempty-limit obligations used by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\\)</span>; the canonical-map typing is restricted to actual <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebras.</li>\n</ul>\n","headi